      542.02,
      496.77
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 586 Name of Land : Perumakumbura alias Dambagahamulla; Description : Scrub jungle; Claimant : State; Original Claimant : Sanjaya Weerasinghe, No. 186, Galle Road, Rathmalana & Premawathie Weerasinghe, No. 129, Middeniya Road, Walasmulla; Extent : 0.1518 Hectare.",
